        {
          "path": "_m/w/9/z/m/hofilena-ancestral-house-wp/heritage-house-grandeu.jpg",
          "filename": "The Heritage House of Grandeur.jpg",
          "caption": "The heritage house of grandeur, the Manuel Severino Hofilena Heritage House, is one of the many heritage houses in Silay City, Negros Occidental that are highly visited because of their grandeur in nature. It is a stone house, or bahay na bato, as they call it. It was built in 1934. It is also a repository of fine and rare art collections of the Hofilenas.",
          "alt": "The heritage house of grandeur, the Manuel Severino Hofilena Heritage House, is one of the many heritage houses in Silay City, Negros Occidental that are highly visited because of their grandeur in nature. It is a stone house, or bahay na bato, as they call it. It was built in 1934. It is also a repository of fine and rare art collections of the Hofilenas.",
