        {
          "path": "_m/w/9/z/m/hofilena-ancestral-house-wp/hofilena-ancestral-house.jpg",
          "filename": "Hofileña Ancestral House.jpg",
          "caption": "Located along the Cinco de Noviembre Street, the Hofileña Ancestral House contains several artifacts and artworks from novice to prominent artists. One can see early sketches of Jose Rizal, paintings by Juan Luan and Felix Resurreccion Hidalgo, and even wood carvings such as a chopping board by national artist, Napoleon Abueva. It also houses interesting and rare toy collections by Mr. Ramon Hofileña that includes miniature dolls which are smaller than a pencil eraser.",
          "alt": "Located along the Cinco de Noviembre Street, the Hofileña Ancestral House contains several artifacts and artworks from novice to prominent artists. One can see early sketches of Jose Rizal, paintings by Juan Luan and Felix Resurreccion Hidalgo, and even wood carvings such as a chopping board by national artist, Napoleon Abueva. It also houses interesting and rare toy collections by Mr. Ramon Hofileña that includes miniature dolls which are smaller than a pencil eraser.",
